{"1444580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EVIL BELOW™", "steam_appid": 1444580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Disclaimer</strong>: This game makes use of your microphone to complete puzzles and combat.<br><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444580/extras/86601d4a56420a234c781d658db748e1.webp?t=1694378754\" width=491 height=30 /></span><br><strong> </strong><br>You wake up. Your head hurts, your vision is distorted and you are alone.<br>Whispers call your name from Below.<br>The Wolf will not let you leave and your only way is down.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444580/extras/ff67f936ee8eb2e820b067816cc8d303.poster.avif?t=1694378754\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444580/extras/ff67f936ee8eb2e820b067816cc8d303.webm?t=1694378754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444580/extras/ff67f936ee8eb2e820b067816cc8d303.mp4?t=1694378754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>EVIL BELOW</strong> is a first-person horror adventure game that combines horror elements with unique puzzle solving and stealth.<br><br>The game centers around a mother searching for her son in a semi-openworld landscape filled with never-ending forests, abandoned villages and claustrophobic caverns.<br>In this world, several creatures made these lands their territory, and you are their prey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444580/extras/a982e9164f13f62af8acc3145602f52b.poster.avif?t=1694378754\" width=600 h